SUMMARY:WQVC Macroinvertebrate & Habitat Assessment Training
DESCRIPTION:Anyone is invited to join us as we train WQVC volunteers and any interested folks on macroinvertebrate sampling techniques. Habitat assessment training is also provided. \nRegistration Link \nFlyer with information!
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/wqvc-macroinvertebrate-habitat-assessment-training/
LOCATION:Greenfield Park\, 1853 William Penn Way\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17601\, United States
END:VEVENT
